From 68c9c010cdea0d1b71accd05c05997eabd17eca3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 09:41:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 08431/11362] ack: object_centric_digest vectorization is inert
 for arc_reset_charge_attribution

Its analyser never calls object_centric_digest (grep confirms zero
references); the REQ-ARC-OCD-VECTORIZE-1 rewrite landed inside an
unrelated conductor sweep commit (95a3fe4438) before this
acknowledgement could be added, so a hook-respecting commit would
otherwise keep hitting this staleness block.
---
 .../outer_loop_arc_reset_charge_attribution_20260726.json | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/results/outer_loop_arc_reset_charge_attribution_20260726.json b/results/outer_loop_arc_reset_charge_attribution_20260726.json
index b4715f2988..fb4fc41a1c 100644
